            <note corresp="#d126-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d126-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 851G.00A/10–1859. Secret; Limit
                    Distribution. Repeated to Phnom Penh, Bangkok, CINCPAC for POLAD, and
                    Vientiane.</p>
            </note>
